
  Step 7/9 • Push

  ✓ Worktrees: feat/a, feat/x
  · All — set by its flag only
  ✓ Descendants: with the worktrees under them
  · Force — no worktree named has uncommitted changes: one picked is kept instead
  ✓ On conflict: abort it
  ✓ Parents: fast-forwarded first

  Force-push each branch synced to origin, leasing on origin's branch as fetched

▌› No, keep them local
   Yes, push them to origin

